HL7 Validation & Decoding SaaS – Requirements Specification
Project Overview

Build a modern web-based HL7 validation and decoding SaaS platform focused on healthcare integration debugging, QA validation, and HL7 message analysis.

The platform should support HL7 v2.5+ messages and provide:

HL7 parsing
message decoding
structural validation
export capabilities
developer-friendly visualization
future SaaS scalability

Primary product identity:

Healthcare integration debugging suite
Healthcare QA platform
Core Goals

The application should:

Parse HL7 v2.5+ messages
Decode messages into human-readable structures
Validate message structure and required fields
Provide detailed error reporting
Support healthcare integration engineers and QA teams
Be scalable into a commercial SaaS platform
Support future enterprise features
