Validation Behavior

Validation strictness must be configurable:

Supported modes:

Strict
Standard
Lenient

Validation engine should detect:

Missing required segments
Missing required fields
Invalid field datatypes
Invalid timestamps
Invalid delimiters
Malformed composite fields
Invalid segment ordering
Unsupported HL7 versions
Unknown segments
Invalid message structures
Invalid repeating fields

Validation severities:

Error
Warning
Info

Each validation issue should include:

Severity
Segment location
Field/component location
Description
Suggested fix
